  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/b423f9e6-5ac6-4689-aff6-c355a8b533d21.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 640px;\" /></p>\n<p>Des dels bous i vaquetes de dijous, amb un bon esglai en quasi colar-se una d&#39;elles dins d&#39;una penya, passant pels actes taurins del segon dissabte i l&#39;actuaci&oacute; del grup d&#39;Onda De Calle,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/IMG_0493.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>fins al primer concert dirigit per Isaac Dur&agrave; Bonet diumenge &uacute;ltim.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesribesalbesoctubre/img_0269.jpg\" alt=\"img_0269\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesribesalbesoctubre/img_0271.jpg\" alt=\"img_0271\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesribesalbesoctubre/img_0272.jpg\" alt=\"img_0272\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesribesalbesoctubre/img_0274.jpg\" alt=\"img_0274\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesribesalbesoctubre/img_0280.jpg\" alt=\"img_0280\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesribesalbesoctubre/img_0281.jpg\" alt=\"img_0281\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesribesalbesoctubre/img_0282.jpg\" alt=\"img_0282\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festesribesalbesoctubre/img_0284.jpg\" alt=\"img_0284\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /